        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">OBI, CDISC</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <obo:IAO_0000232 xml:lang="en">govt agents responsible for creating regulations; proxies for enforcing regulations.  CDISC definition:  regulatory authorities. Bodies having the power to regulate. NOTE: In the ICH GCP guideline the term includes the authorities that review submitted clinical data and those that conduct inspections. These bodies are sometimes referred to as competent</obo:IAO_0000232>
